'' '#if' INSIDE A PROCEDURE sees its own 'const' and 'dim' until 'end sub', reads a string const,
'' takes a string as FALSE and a 'u'-suffixed literal as unsigned (fbc's pp/if.bas).
'' Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/pp-if-locals.bas -o tests/codegen/ppiflocals.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/ppiflocals.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: a b c d e 
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: - - - i j - 
